@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<section class="article-page">
    <div class="section-inner article-header">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="article-meta">Last updated: September 16, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section-inner article-body legal-content">
        <p>Avena ("we", "us") operates this website. This policy explains what
        information we collect and how we use it.</p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Account data:</strong> username, display name, and password (stored hashed) when you register.</li>
            <li><strong>Content you submit:</strong> news posts, comments, and images you upload.</li>
            <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> pages viewed, article view counts.</li>
            <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> we use a session cookie to keep you logged in.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>To provide and maintain your account and let you post content.</li>
            <li>To display your username alongside comments and posts you make.</li>
            <li>To improve the site's functionality.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>We do not sell your personal data to third parties.</p>

        <h2>Data Retention</h2>
        <p>We retain your account and content data for as long as your account
        is active. You may request deletion by contacting us at
        <a href="mailto:avenanews@gmail.com">avenanews@gmail.com</a>.</p>

        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>Our site may link to third-party platforms (Instagram, TikTok).
        We are not responsible for their privacy practices.</p>

        <h2>Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your
        personal data at any time by contacting
        <a href="mailto:avenanews@gmail.com">avenanews@gmail.com</a>.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about this policy? Contact us at
        <a href="mailto:avenanews@gmail.com">avenanews@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
</section>
